<title>JAPAN: Nireco -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nireco -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.33		vs	    3.85</p>
<p> Operating	  448    million	  vs	  334    million</p>
<p> Current	    474    million	  vs	  396    million</p>
<p> Net		  268    million	  vs	  173    million</p>
